recentItems.description:
This interview was carefully restored from 2 different source tapes. The interview itself was conducted in 1979 between the production of Star Wars and The Empire Strikes Back. It was to promote the re-release of Star Wars before Empire was released in 1980. Truth be told I had to use a little AI to reconstruct some of the interview dialog as some words were clipped and scratchy. It's not perfect but it was the best I could do. 

